@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@tenantId = demo-tenant
@apiKey = demo-key-change-me

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### SaaS chat
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

