### Current subscription
GET {{baseUrl}}/saas/subscription
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Create ticket (explicit user action)
POST {{baseUrl}}/saas/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

